{
  "about": [
    "The app's icons in each icon pack (lib/art/icon_packs.dart): every glyph the app draws, by its Lucide name (lib/art/lucide.g.dart, and the app's own drawings by the Lucide name of what they draw), to the name of the same glyph in each pack.",
    "null is a pack with no such glyph: the app draws Lucide's there, in the chosen style. Read by tool/icons/generate.dart, which writes lib/art/packs/*.g.dart from the packs' own SVGs (fetched by tool/icons/fetch.sh into a folder outside the repository) and says how many fell back."
  ],
